{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use bombs to move around and reach the top of a universe filled with obstacles, and find help to regain your human form. Watch out for falls! Are you ready to take on this challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/6b5631f07ba8deea195a02b3845dcca2.apng?t=1772210508\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/6b5631f07ba8deea195a02b3845dcca2.poster.avif?t=1772210508\" class=\"bb_img\" width=192 height=192 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/cb0126fade0a45cd762a081cdc715e1c.webp?t=1772210508\" width=160 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You play as a skeleton stuck in a flower pot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>No one really knows why.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/333cdaab3b965c2c453ef3a30c566730.avif?t=1772210508\" width=78 height=162 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/e5ca477684d8f2fefc32fee048b5a046.webp?t=1772210508\" width=232 height=60 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The goal is to reach the summit and meet someone who might be able to help you regain your human form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>People are extremely friendly in this world.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/a94df74311e333522389c3d4ac0b18c7.poster.avif?t=1772210508\" width=660 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/a94df74311e333522389c3d4ac0b18c7.webm?t=1772210508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/a94df74311e333522389c3d4ac0b18c7.mp4?t=1772210508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/070d04b8ed09262c6aeeb5bd4bd29f95.webp?t=1772210508\" width=256 height=44 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hold down the left mouse button to aim where you want to send the bomb.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Release the left mouse button to fire the bomb.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hold down the right mouse button to control the power of the explosion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Release the right mouse button to trigger the explosion or hold down the right click until maximum power is reached.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Pretty simple, right?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/8353bfb8f34be5e7aa5c207207770831.poster.avif?t=1772210508\" width=480 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/8353bfb8f34be5e7aa5c207207770831.webm?t=1772210508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/8353bfb8f34be5e7aa5c207207770831.mp4?t=1772210508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/0de58afc884614709c740d9991b5e36a.webp?t=1772210508\" width=200 height=60 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A colorful pixel art universe and a medieval fantasy setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/f2aa399402ee38ec65597ce6c2dc0b29.avif?t=1772210508\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/d4176c8352ab334b6573af1c4b19e97a.webp?t=1772210508\" width=224 height=44 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">It seems that stylish outfits are hiding everywhere...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/cc70e1674fe2fb10a922d3fe572adb2a.poster.avif?t=1772210508\" width=168 height=177 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/cc70e1674fe2fb10a922d3fe572adb2a.webm?t=1772210508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/b2c6f6e706ef009f7bb300f615dacb2e.webp?t=1772210508\" width=280 height=52 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If, after completing the game and its various possible endings, you still want more, there are specific challenges remaining in each area of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Pssst... this is for experts. :)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/e972124f5a1bd38b49dc49891cd1d1dd.avif?t=1772210508\" width=432 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/766eb5227b06ceb04ffb35168d9546f2.webp?t=1772210508\" width=240 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">On your marks, get set, fall!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/fe218f37db7cf10004cb9dad0e516894.poster.avif?t=1772210508\" width=562 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/fe218f37db7cf10004cb9dad0e516894.webm?t=1772210508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/fe218f37db7cf10004cb9dad0e516894.mp4?t=1772210508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/bdd267a477c65e113f0db6cfa854b15e.webp?t=1772210508\" width=216 height=60 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This game is inspired by the famous <strong><u>\u201cJump King\u201d by Nexile</u></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explosion animation:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ansimuz explosion-animations-pack</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Trailer music: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot;Take a Chance&quot; Kevin MacLeod (incompetech)</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First time ever","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3642650/7fac030cdacfae69d2a15b8851a261e64782e627.jpg"},{"name":"Dramatic ending","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3642650/74f4cfdceb5291516c4dcbe0c030317fcc0acbb4.jpg"},{"name":"A kiss!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3642650/648f2b93a922accebb70111690ca33345e912951.jpg"},{"name":"That was tough...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3642650/f60684032d62ce745c1018c46903b3b23f607b0a.jpg"},{"name":"Fastest Ever","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3642650/db0c0e8cc7df2a66620e60a58229e5de80150f55.jpg"},{"name":"Fast, but Not the Fastest","path":"