_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/6b5631f07ba8deea195a02b3845dcca2.apng?t=1772210508\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/6b5631f07ba8deea195a02b3845dcca2.poster.avif?t=1772210508\" class=\"bb_img\" width=192 height=192 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/cb0126fade0a45cd762a081cdc715e1c.webp?t=1772210508\" width=160 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You play as a skeleton stuck in a flower pot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>No one really knows why.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/333cdaab3b965c2c453ef3a30c566730.avif?t=1772210508\" width=78 height=162 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/e5ca477684d8f2fefc32fee048b5a046.webp?t=1772210508\" width=232 height=60 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The goal is to reach the summit and meet someone who might be able to help you regain your human form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>People are extremely friendly in this world.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/a94df74311e333522389c3d4ac0b18c7.poster.avif?t=1772210508\" width=660 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/a94df74311e333522389c3d4ac0b18c7.webm?t=1772210508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/a94df74311e333522389c3d4ac0b18c7.mp4?t=1772210508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/070d04b8ed09262c6aeeb5bd4bd29f95.webp?t=1772210508\" width=256 height=44 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hold down the left mouse button to aim where you want to send the bomb.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Release the left mouse button to fire the bomb.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hold down the right mouse button to control the power of the explosion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Release the right mouse button to trigger the explosion or hold down the right click until maximum power is reached.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Pretty simple, right?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/8353bfb8f34be5e7aa5c207207770831.poster.avif?t=1772210508\" width=480 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/8353bfb8f34be5e7aa5c207207770831.webm?t=1772210508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/8353bfb8f34be5e